OL,3,GNEWSALittle-Pengelly criticises O'Neill
OL,4,Aas nationalist first ministers to meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deputy first minister has accused
OL,7,Frepublicanism of attempting to
OL,8,F"weaponise the role of the first
OL,9,Fminister", as Michelle O'Neill is due
OL,10,Fto meet the first ministers of Wales
OL,11,Fand Scotland to discuss ways of
OL,12,F"working more closely".
OL,14,FIn Northern Ireland, the first and
OL,15,Fdeputy first minister have identical
OL,16,Fpowers and responsibilities.
OL,18,FLittle-Pengelly criticised O'Neill for
OL,19,Fattending Monday's talks.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
