OL,3,GNEWSALittle-Pengelly criticises O'Neill
OL,4,Aas nationalist first ministers to meet
OL,5,
OL,6,F"She has not sought any agreement or
OL,7,Fpermission from me to travel, attend or
OL,8,Fsign anything as first minister. She
OL,9,Fwould have needed to do so to do
OL,10,Fanything as FM," the deputy first
OL,11,Fminister said.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
